  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. – and +\n\n24 - __**36 × 32**__ + __**8 ÷ 20**__ = 148\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 1152 __**+ 0.4**__ = 148\n\n⇒ __**24.4 - 1152**__ = 148\n\n⇒ -1127.6 ≠ 148\n\n2. + and ÷\n\n__**24 ÷ 36**__ × 32 – 8 + 20 = 148\n\n⇒ __**0.67 × 32**__ – 8 + 20 = 148\n\n⇒ __**21.44**__ – 8 __**+ 20**__ = 148\n\n⇒ __**41.44**____** – 8**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 33.44 ≠ 148\n\n3. + and ×\n\n__**24 × 36**__ + 32 – __**8 ÷ 20**__ = 148\n\n⇒ __**864 + 32**__ - 0.4 = 148\n\n⇒ __**896 - 0.4**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 895.6 ≠ 148\n\n4. ÷ and – \n\n24 + 36 × __**32 ÷ 8**__ - 20 = 148\n\n⇒ 24 + __**36 × 4**__ - 20 = 148\n\n⇒ __**24 + 144**__ - 20 = 148\n\n⇒ __**168**____** -**____** 20**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 148 = 148\n\nHence, '**÷ and –**' is the correct answer.",
